{'symbol': 'SYK', 'date': '2020-11-09 07:30:00', 'title': 'STRYKER ELECTS GIOVANNI CAFORIO TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'KALAMAZOO, MICHIGAN, NOV. 09, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- STRYKER (NYSE:SYK) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT GIOVANNI CAFORIO, M.D., CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF BRISTOL MYERS SQUIBB, HAS BEEN ELECTED TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 1, 2020.\xa0'}